A very customizable high-precision metronome.
 
Metronome is an essential utility for musicians, which helps to practice music and stay in sync with the rhythm. Our app combines the aesthetics of the mechanical metronomes and versatility of the electronic ones.

The app features 4 distinct modes:
► Classical - the pendulum metronome that everyone is used to;
► Count - for those who prefer verbal clues;
► Rhythm - a very flexible and customizable digital metronome;
► Polyrhythm - to help you practice those 3:4 and other polyrhythmic sections.

For your convenience, the app also provides:
► A flexible BPM (beats per minute) selection;
► The dark mode;
► Presets.

Browse, mark, preview, and apply the presets from the catalog containing 80 BPM presets and a few rhythm and polyrhythm presets. Or save your own ones. 

System requirements:
► iOS 13.2 or newer.

Recommended devices:
► iPhone 6S or newer.
